Shopping for beats on Beat22? We’ve made the checkout process smooth and flexible, no matter where you're from.

![](/images/2025/07/Screenshot-2025-07-01-130126.png)

Here are the payment methods you can use:

### **In India:**

-   **UPI** (Google Pay, PhonePe, Paytm, etc.)
-   **Credit/Debit Cards** (Visa, Mastercard, RuPay)
-   **Net Banking** (All major banks supported)
-   **Wallets** (Paytm, Mobikwik, Freecharge)

### **For buyers outside India:**

-   **PayPal** – Secure and widely accepted
-   **International Debit/Credit Cards** (Visa, Mastercard, Amex)

### **Quick tips:**

-   All payments are **100% secure and encrypted**.
-   You’ll get an **instant download** and **license certificate** after payment.
-   If a payment fails, try another method or reach out to support@beat22.com.

We’ve got you covered – wherever you are in the world. Find your beat. Pay your way. Start creating.
